## Ported from AK/UFixedBigInt.h:498 AK::Detail::operator<=>(BuiltInUFixedInt, NotBuiltInUFixedInt).
pub func cmp_opaque[T, TStorage](a: T, b: UFixedBigInt[TStorage]) -> i32:
