## Ported from AK/UFixedBigInt.h:499 AK::Detail::operator==(IntegerWrapper, NotBuiltInUFixedInt).
pub func eq_integer_wrapper[TStorage](a: IntegerWrapper, b: UFixedBigInt[TStorage]) -> bool:
