## Ported from AK/UFixedBigInt.h:500 AK::Detail::operator<=>(IntegerWrapper, NotBuiltInUFixedInt).
pub func cmp_integer_wrapper[TStorage](a: IntegerWrapper, b: UFixedBigInt[TStorage]) -> i32:
